# Lines 11-12 mix upper and lower hex digits and must fire. All-upper,
# all-lower, digits-only and one-case-with-digits hex, and decimals must not.
# Known FP shape: none expected; e in a decimal float (1e5) is not hex.
mixed-case-hex 11
mixed-case-hex 12
!mixed-case-hex 13
!mixed-case-hex 14
!mixed-case-hex 15
!mixed-case-hex 16
!mixed-case-hex 17
!mixed-case-hex 18
